<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/>
<view class="page"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><block wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}">
<view class="eyebrow">MORE TIME FOR YOURSELF</view><view class="heading">留一点时光，照顾自己。</view><view class="subtitle">让每一天的小坚持，多一点从容。</view><view wx:if="{{!signedIn}}" class="card section"><view class="empty">登录模拟账号，即可获得一次新人体验卡。</view><button class="btn" data-url="/pages/account/index" bindtap="go">开启我的体验</button></view><block wx:else><view class="hero member-hero section"><view class="row"><text class="pill light">{{membership.activeGrant ? '模拟会员 · 生效中' : '暂无生效中的模拟权益'}}</text><image class="member-icon" src="/images/ui/member.svg"/></view><view class="hero-title">{{membership.activeGrant ? membership.activeGrant.title : '下一份轻盈时光，等你开启'}}</view><view class="hero-desc">{{membership.activeGrant ? membership.activeGrant.start + ' 至 ' + membership.activeGrant.end + ' 00:00' : '完成挑战，领取模拟会员体验卡。'}}</view><view class="member-quota"><view><view class="number">{{membership.remaining}}<text class="unit">次</text></view><text class="small-text">今日剩余</text></view><view><view class="number">{{membership.used}}<text class="unit">次</text></view><text class="small-text">今日已用</text></view><view><view class="number">{{membership.dailyLimit}}<text class="unit">次</text></view><text class="small-text">每日额度</text></view></view><button class="btn mt" data-url="{{membership.remaining ? '/pages/photo/index' : '/pages/challenges/index'}}" bindtap="go">{{membership.remaining ? '拍下这一餐，记下今天 ↗' : '看看可以参与的挑战 ↗'}}</button></view>
<view class="section"><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">我的权益时光</text><text class="small-text">按领取先后顺延</text></view><view wx:if="{{!membership.timeline.length}}" class="card empty">还没有领取过体验卡，去看看挑战吧。</view><view wx:for="{{membership.timeline}}" wx:key="id" class="card timeline-card"><view class="row"><view class="timeline-dot {{item.status === '生效中' ? 'active-dot' : ''}}"></view><view class="grow"><view class="title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="small-text mt-sm">{{item.start}} — {{item.end}} 00:00</view><view class="small-text mt-sm">{{item.days}} 天 · 每日 {{item.dailyLimit}} 次模拟识餐</view></view><text class="pill {{item.status === '待生效' ? 'gold' : ''}}">{{item.status}}</text></view></view></view></block><view class="section"><view class="section-title mb">关于你的权益</view><view class="card"><view class="benefit"><image class="inline-icon" src="/images/ui/sun.svg"/><view><view class="title">每天都有新的开始</view><text class="caption">每日额度按北京时间 00:00 重置，不累积；权益到期后不再提供额度。</text></view></view><view class="benefit"><image class="inline-icon" src="/images/ui/gift.svg"/><view><view class="title">每份礼物，都有自己的时光</view><text class="caption">新领取的体验卡接在已有权益后生效，同一天只有一份权益提供额度。</text></view></view><view class="benefit"><image class="inline-icon" src="/images/ui/shield.svg"/><view><view class="title">成功记好，才消耗一次</view><text class="caption">取消选图、保存失败不扣额度；删除已生成的日记不返还额度。</text></view></view></view></view><view class="notice warn section">此页仅展示模拟权益，尚未接入真实会员、支付与广告服务。</view>
</block><view class="footnote">轻动 · 每一步坚持，都值得被看见</view></view>
